    <section id="about" class="about-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">About Us</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>Nrutyashree Dance Academy was founded with a vision to preserve and promote the ancient art of classical Indian dance. Our academy is dedicated to nurturing the talent of dancers of all ages, providing them with the technical skills and artistic knowledge to excel in this timeless art form.</p>
                <p>With a foundation rooted in traditional Bharatanatyam, we embrace the philosophy that dance is not merely a performance art but a spiritual journey. Our accomplished faculty brings decades of experience and a deep understanding of the cultural significance of each movement, rhythm, and expression.</p>
                <p>At Nrutyashree, we believe that dance is a language that transcends barriers, telling stories that resonate with the human experience across cultures and generations. Join us in celebrating this divine art form that has been passed down through millennia.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-image">
                <img src="../images/about_us_img.jpg" alt="Nrutyashree Dance Performance" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

